        "original_id": "32ebe13f-b64f-56af-864f-b72986f464d8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bryan Kocis, Bryan Phillips, Brent Everett, Sean Paul Lockhart, Brent Corrigan, Harlow Cuadra, Joseph Kerekes\n- Works: Schoolboy Crush\n- Companies: Cobra Video\n- Topics: gay pornographic films, murder convictions, life imprisonment\n\nFacts:\n- In 2004, Schoolboy Crush was released as a controversial gay pornographic film on Cobra Video.\n- Schoolboy Crush was directed by Bryan Kocis, who used the industry name Bryan Phillips.\n- Schoolboy Crush featured Brent Everett and Sean Paul Lockhart, with Sean Paul Lockhart using the stage name Brent Corrigan.\n- Harlow Cuadra and Joseph Kerekes were charged with and convicted of the murder of Bryan Kocis.\n- Harlow Cuadra and Joseph Kerekes were subsequently sentenced to life imprisonment without the possibility of parole.",
